@overheard bunk
// Writer-commons, overheard batch 1. Bunkmates, in the junior wing or on the way to bed.

== overheard
? pair:bunk time:night deck:4
A: Lights out.
B: It's five to.
A: Lights out in five, then.   #funny

? pair:bunk time:morning deck:4
A: Were you talking in your sleep?
B: Was I?
A: About pumps. At length.   #funny

? pair:bunk deck:4
A: Who left a sock on my bunk?
B: Lost property's got your other one.
A: There's a lost-property box?
B: There are four.   #funny

? pair:bunk time:evening deck:4
A: Hot water's nearly gone.
B: Then it's character-building.
A: I've got plenty of character.

? pair:bunk time:night deck:4
A: You awake?
B: No.
A: Me neither. Goodnight.   #warm

? pair:bunk deck:4
A: Holt inspects on Thursday.
B: I know. I've folded my blanket twice.
A: Holt can tell.
B: That's what I'm afraid of.   #funny
